WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.590
That is a complete fabrication!

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:40.130
I hereby pronounce Princess Katajina guilty and sentence her to death.

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:45.010
This is the last time you and I will meet.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:49.520
I'm soon to be executed for a crime I didn't commit.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.960
The King is under the influence of Ragnid Gottfried.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:02:00.170
Whatever happens from this point onwards, you are the Crown Princess of this land, Orgeld!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.700
It is time.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.290
Orgeld, watch your mother's last moments.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:10.870
Watch how lust makes sacrifices of man!

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.350
Mother!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.190
Mother!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:31.410
Episode 37 - The Two Princesses: Act One

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.240
Princess Aldis.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.690
We wish you a happy birthday!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.830
Princess Aldis, not only are you beautiful beyond compare,

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:44.180
your smile is that of the Spring Goddess, warming the hearts of men!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:51.640
Presenting His Royal Highness, the King, and Princess Aldis!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:58.250
I would like to thank all of you for gracing my birthday celebrations with your presence.

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.280
I would like to show you my gratitude.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.900
Oh, we could never ask anything of you, Princess!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:07.890
We are simply happy to be here to celebrate the glorious event of your birth,

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.580
Your Majesty!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.330
I'm cold. It's so cold in here.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:22.020
The silence of the dungeon is that of the grave.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.330
It transforms even the smallest sound in one's heart into a cacophony.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:31.600
This cold air stirs my anger.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.710
My kingdom: Lastonia.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.720
The Winter Emperor rules this land for six months every year.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:45.460
The arrows of ice and my armor of snow have frozen my heart.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.260
I am Princess Orgeld!

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:57.020
Mankind's cold heart has turned me into the Winter Emperor's daughter!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:57.020
<i>Wow. The audience have been completely transported to the frozen lands of Lastonia.</i>

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:01.020
My kingdom: Lastonia.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.220
The Winter Emperor rules this land for six months every year.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:12.300
But I know that the smile of the Spring Goddess is stronger than the Winter Emperor's sword.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:19.570
I would like to be the daughter of the Spring Goddess for every man and woman of this kingdom.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.670
<i>It's so strange.</i>

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:21.350
<i>The ice has thawed and I now feel warmth.</i>

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.340
That girl's aura is the warmth of spring!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:31.450
You would have me become the head of that treasonous rabble, the Red Lily?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.610
We need you more than ever, now that our enemy, Erinwald, has forged...

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:36.810
an alliance with Denmark.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:40.230
So, my time has finally come.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.400
I wish to enter the convent!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.390
Make the necessary arrangements!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.350
I see.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.640
If I enter the convent, I can escape this place.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.440
When the time comes, we will help you to make your escape to our secret headquarters!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:59.920
I will finally leave this prison, but I'm not joining the convent.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.950
Nor the Red Lily....

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.420
Princess Orgeld's carriage has arrived.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.670
Capture them! They are members of the Red Lily!

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.970
Why are you doing this, Princess?!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:17.720
That man! He's the leader of this treasonous rabble!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.650
You would betray me, Princess Orgeld?!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:23.400
You speak of betrayal? This is not betrayal.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.370
I am the daughter of his Royal Majesty.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:30.980
Are you not the one betraying your country with your treason?

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.970
You underestimated me, my lord.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.480
It is obvious that you should not have trusted me.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:46.340
I believe in no-one and love no-one!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.730
My rise to power has only just begun!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:56.430
She was locked in a dungeon eight years hence and yet, she still holds me in such high regard...

00:05:56.430 --> 00:06:01.300
But, I want you to hear her words, your Majesty!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.040
You would have me betroth Aldis to our rivals?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.710
Instead of quarreling with them, we should seek an alliance through marriage.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:11.570
To offer the princess as a bride...

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:14.160
to the House of Erinwald would establish our intentions of peace!

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.370
You would send her to them to be a hostage?

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.840
How can you even think she would live safely in the land of our enemies?

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:19.900
But, Your Majesty...

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:23.110
Me... a hostage?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.210
If war broke out, I would be killed.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.630
No!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:31.870
They have sent me such a beautiful bouquet.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:34.650
This is another present from Princess Aldis.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.680
Isn't she kind?

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.620
I've never met my younger sister,

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:43.990
but I hear that there is no-one in the kingdom that does not love her.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:49.600
My younger sister, Aldis.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.140
You would have us send you to Erinwald?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:57.550
I have spent my whole life in a dungeon. There is nothing that I fear.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:01.980
Aldis is yet young; this role should be mine.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:06.580
The audience is transfixed on Ayumi Himekawa.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:12.180
Hasn't anyone noticed that Orgeld has become the star of the play?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:16.310
You are indeed my daughter, Orgeld!

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.720
I have but one wish, my father.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:21.560
A wish, you say?

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:25.240
Yes. A single wish.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.210
Let me hear it.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:32.820
I would like to have proof that I am your daughter.

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.110
How do you mean?

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:38.150
Would you announce before the court that I am your daughter?

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.750
That is my wish.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:45.780
If I can be granted this highest of accolades as the Crown Princess of Lastonia,

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:49.410
I can leave for our enemy lands as a bride with no compunction.

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:55.400
Then, when the time comes, I can die as my father's daughter!

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:58.400
Such magnificent words, Orgeld!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.960
This calls for celebration!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:03.400
Chancellor, go tell the Empress Dowager in her northern court!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:08.350
O Knight of Fate... can you see me smiling now?

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.760
Have you heard?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.860
Ayumi's movements are all planned out.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.590
They say that Princess Orgeld is being sent to Erinwald as a bride!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:21.750
Presenting Her Majesty, the Empress Dowager Haldora!

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.180
I have kept you waiting.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:34.690
I would have expected nothing less from her.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.710
Her very stance captures the audience's attention.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.630
This is indeed a pitiable affair.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.670
I simply did not have enough power.

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.590
Please, forgive me.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.770
No.

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:48.210
That's not the way of things.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:52.770
To celebrate this holy union, we present the Royal Heirloom, the Gilded Dragon Necklace...

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.770
<i>What's that expression she's wearing?</i>

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:56.850
<i>It's like her entire body is radiating with joy at meeting her sister for the first time.</i>

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:56.850
and the Bejeweled Sword. All shall be sent with the bride to Erinwald.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.950
Our treasures?!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.870
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.510
Orgeld, it is natural for one to value oneself.

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:18.090
So tell me: why would you consent to let yourself be married off to our enemy?

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.090
Answer, Orgeld.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:26.880
She did it for me! She took my place!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.510
Oh, I've wanted to meet you so badly, elder sister!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:31.760
Aldis!

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.830
Her smile doesn't even hint at caution.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.680
What an expression!

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:44.440
I'm pleased to meet you, Orgeld, my sister.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:52.540
I don't even know what to say to you after the sacrifice you have made for me.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:56.270
Grandmother, I wanted to say that...

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.270
<i>They're all looking at her. The whole audience is taken in by her.</i>

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.940
She's completely different than in rehearsals.

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:04.620
Yes, when she's on stage, her instinct really comes alive!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.940
And yet, the darkness in my heart cannot dissipate.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:14.570
Aldis, I cannot express to you how much I've wanted to meet you.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.600
Will you promise to have faith in me, come what may?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:24.080
Of course! But there is one thing I would like you to promise me, O sister of mine.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.480
What is it, Aldis?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.520
Promise me that you won't die!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:33.680
Maya, this power! That fierce look in your eyes!

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:39.320
Yes, I promise.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:46.110
Maya, this stage is a battle. Let's fight to our hearts' content!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.540
We'll show Harland!

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:57.160
We'll take their forts and their territories in the name of Lastonia!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.010
To arms!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.900
Seizing this copper mine should be sufficient...

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.070
No, it's not enough! We need an all-out war!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.820
And who will pay for such a war?

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:07.300
The resulting tax will only burden our people further.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:11.590
If we capture Harland, they will no longer care for taxes.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.010
Our country shall be victorious.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.610
You'll regret this.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.950
Why must the men war and slaughter their kin?

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:27.720
A year has gone by and the fighting still rages.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.400
My father is still bedridden,

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.020
and word has reached me that scores have been wounded in the fighting.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:39.550
A year has gone by and Lastonia is still at war.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:44.190
It must continue, so that Lastonia falls to its knees.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:48.100
What can I do to end this war?

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.450
What can I do to draw this war out?

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:54.540
I must do something, for I am the Princess!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.720
I must do something to cause Lastonia's demise!

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.310
Water! Please, give me water!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.690
These are the people of Lastonia?

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.840
Here is the exposed face of truth.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.840
Those living in the castle and the court have made no effort to see their suffering.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.420
Oh, blessing of blessings!

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:17.410
From her expression,

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:21.590
I can see Aldis's conflicting emotions on her first time outside the walls of the castle.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:26.310
I may never trust anyone.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:29.970
I may never love anyone.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:35.060
Aldis, my stepsister. She claims to believe in me.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:39.130
What made me think of her just now?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.740
The day will come when she regrets those words.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:51.780
I want to fight! I want to end the war and to restore the hearts of my people.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.380
I must fight.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:58.390
I will now visit the northern courts of my grandmother!

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:03.480
Her acting is becoming more and more natural.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:09.890
You wish to use these northern courts as a hospital?

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:14.930
I cannot simply hide in my court and watch the suffering of my people in silence!

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:21.780
Aldis, when I tried to prove the innocence of Orgeld's mother,

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.320
I became the target of power struggles and conspiracies.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:30.160
Since then, I have grown to hate the Royal Court and have locked myself away here.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.180
Empress Dowager...

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:38.670
And yet, the sound of your voice has reminded me what blood flows in these veins!

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:44.390
You may have the power to become the shining light of this nation.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.750
Live on, as the Princess of Light.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.350
The Princess of Light.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.860
You shall have these courts to do with as you please.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:54.960
Grandmother!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:59.900
Aldis is using her northern courts as a hospital for injured soldiers?

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:03.560
It seems that the King and the noblemen have started donating money to treat their wounds.

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:07.350
But if that happens, the people's faith in their King will be restored!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.400
I cannot allow that to happen.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.670
And yet, I believe I can use this situation.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:21.160
I have been told that my elder sister is sending us twelve doctors.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.800
She's so benevolent!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:29.800
No-one in the Royal House holds our country in higher regard than Princess Orgeld.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.870
My dearest sister,

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:39.790
your twelve doctors are working in the northern courts tirelessly day after day to treat the wounded.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:44.820
I cannot stand war. I cannot stand hatred.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:53.510
The Lord tells us to love our enemies, for is it not love that makes us truly strong?

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.800
From your loving younger sister, Aldis.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.340
What a stupid child.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.640
You want the war to end soon?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.830
Unfortunately, that would inconvenience me.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.860
You say we should love our enemies?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:14.160
My father has betrayed both trust and love for his own selfish interests,

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:18.470
and you, Aldis, and the whole House of Gottfried.

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:21.550
You're wrong, Aldis!

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:24.840
Hatred. That's what gives people strength!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.300
To arms, men!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.240
Do not be fooled by the Royal House!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.940
Do not be deceived!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.830
And how is the Red Lily's Dean faring in Lastonia?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.650
They have stormed the houses of the country's more prominent lords.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:43.400
They have confiscated their riches and have set about distributing them amongst the poor.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.390
The treasonous factions grow in stature by the day!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:51.430
Your Royal Highness, the leader of the citizens demands an audience with you!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.480
What do you say?

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.660
Bring him out!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:56.600
This is an outrage! Quell this uprising at once!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.430
Mother!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.480
Bring out the King!

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:02.150
He will hear our voice!

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:07.000
Show your face!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.900
Let me go.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:14.140
Come with me to the balcony, Jurgis.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:15.940
But, Your Highness...

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.440
That face... she's not acting anymore.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.450
Open the door to the balcony.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.030
Bring out the King!

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.650
Give us the King!

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.860
Aldis!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:44.040
Brave people of Lastonia!

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.080
Please, stop your protests!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.360
Listen to me, please! I wish to bring peace...

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.770
and serenity back to this land as quickly as possible.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.910
The King and I love you all!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.550
I would hope you could believe in that love.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:08.160
Has anyone from the Royal House ever listened to us before?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:11.140
The glory of God is with our Princess!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:14.140
Long live Princess Aldis!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:17.950
You were magnificent, Princess Aldis.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:21.130
You are truly this country's Princess!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.830
Your Majesty, the beloved King of Harland.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:32.220
More than ever, I wish for this war to end.

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:36.320
Please believe us and hear our prayers.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:40.780
I put my love and trust into this letter.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.320
But this is an invitation to Harland's Independence Ceremony!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.680
Princess, this is a trap!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.190
They are testing you to see if your desire to end the war is earnest!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.170
So, Harland tests me, do they?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.690
Then, let us go to Harland.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:08.020
If we wish to be trusted, we must also trust. Is that not so?

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:13.020
Love and smiles are the only weapons in this Princess's arsenal!

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:16.510
What can she possibly achieve by going to Harland, the land of our enemy?

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:19.470
What a beautiful smile!

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:22.970
Maya, the audience is yours.

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.010
In the next scene, everyone will be looking at me.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:30.250
Princess Aldis of Lastonia!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:30.260
But which one of us will they be looking at when the curtain falls?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:37.420
Thank you for your invitation to Harland's Independence Day Ceremonies, Your Majesty.

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:33.770
That's what I want to know!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.750
She's as beautiful as the rumors say!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:44.690
An armistice?

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.510
Are you trying to forge peace?

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:51.390
Do you really believe you can rule a country with love alone, Aldis?

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.440
Strength is what you need to rule!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:57.130
Men desire riches and power more than peace!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:02.150
Send out an envoy to Lastonia and tell them to crush Harland's troops!

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:08.230
They told us they wished for peace but it was all a ruse!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:10.470
Long live the King!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.400
Long live Lastonia!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.900
Long live Erinwald!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:16.490
Long live Princess Orgeld!

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:20.170
The King is in a bad way.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:25.180
If he dies, the next in line for the throne will be Katajina's daughter,

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.470
Orgeld.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.890
I must do something.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.440
I must get Aldis to the throne!

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:39.270
And now, the First Crown Princess of Lastonia, Orgeld, has finally returned.

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:42.490
Our father is very sick, dear elder sister.

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.220
I'm aware of that, Aldis.

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:48.390
I thought coming to see him was the least I could do.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:52.600
And should something happen while I'm here...

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:58.460
He's dead.

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:04.330
And you die here with him, Orgeld!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.010
I think not.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:09.580
These men...

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:11.080
My Erinwald soldiers:

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:16.140
Capture all who were implicit in the plot to murder the Crown Princess of Lastonia!

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:23.740
Grandfather? Mother? Where are you?

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:28.400
I can't believe you tried to assassinate my sister.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:32.770
Oh, God have mercy! May they escape the death penalty!

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.670
Princess!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.420
Oh, Vienna! I'm so glad to see you!

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.220
I thought I'd never see you again!

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:44.120
I'm so glad you're safe, Princess!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:50.280
I can't believe you've been locked away in a place like this.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:53.130
No matter what happens, we can't lose hope.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:58.460
No matter how long the winter lasts, spring will always return.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:04.620
Tell me, dearest Orgeld, how was father's funeral?

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.500
I hope death found him with a peaceful expression.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:14.530
I wish only for you to know my love and truest intentions.

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:21.760
Here is the torment of being constantly ignored, Aldis.

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:26.100
How loud the crows are today!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:32.110
Dear elder sister! Dear, dear sister Orgeld!

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:34.010
I knew you'd come for me!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:35.920
Elder sister?!

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:40.110
The two princesses have switched places.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:44.430
How will you act this one out now, Ayumi?

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:48.990
Maya, go and win our wager!

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:29.390
Maya. Since you've stepped up on stage, you haven't slipped back into your own self even once.

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:31.720
Your heart is Aldis's.

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:36.370
That is true acting talent.

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:44.490
Even if everyone is enthralled by Ayumi's Orgeld, someone will surely notice...

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:50.780
that you cannot have shadow without light!

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 38 - The Two Princesses: Act Two
